$add('MOTION-001', 'Animation', 'Motion system rebuilt on real spring curves', 'pass', 'Easing is now a damped spring (CSS linear(), 8% and 16% overshoot) with a cubic-bezier fallback. Panels arrive in reading order with children following through, bars squash and stretch, buttons wind down on press and spring back, the sidebar pill squashes and stretches as it travels between items, the sidebar and its items follow through when it pops out, rows pull back before they leave, toasts arrive on an arc and show a countdown, status dots breathe, the header gains a shadow on scroll, cards have a light that follows the cursor and disclosure panels open with a spring. Measured in a real browser: the sidebar reaches the edge in about 0.4 s, overshoots by about 6% and settles by 1.2 s; the pill is squashed mid-move and returns to exactly its resting size.');
